    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "A fever a week after a tick bite means I'd think of Lyme disease, though it could just be a virus, so I'm treating Lyme disease as a possibility, not a certainty.",
